## 3. Matrix Client Initialization

**File**: `/Users/stjepandzojic/projects/cloakanddagger/src/modules/matrix-client/services/matrix-service.ts`

```typescript
// Build the client
this.instance = await new ClientBuilder()
  .serverNameOrHomeserverUrl(serverUrl)
  .sessionPaths(dataPath, cachePath)  // enables persistent E2EE stores
  .autoEnableBackups(false)
  .build();

// Restore or create session
await client.restoreSession({
  accessToken, refreshToken, userId, deviceId,
  homeserverUrl, oidcData: undefined,
  slidingSyncVersion: SlidingSyncVersion.Native,
});

// Start sync
this.syncService = await client.syncService().finish();
await this.syncService.start();

// Wait for E2EE to initialize
await client.encryption().waitForE2eeInitializationTasks();
```

The `MatrixService` is a static singleton class. After initialization it sets Jotai atoms (`MatrixAtoms.matrixClient`, `MatrixAtoms.syncService`, `MatrixAtoms.profile`) via a global Jotai store (`MatrixJotaiStore = getDefaultStore()`).

